rss_mb.description:
The **whole daemon's** memory in MB, not this checkpoint's share: one number, the same
on every entry (57 §2.1 item 4). macOS `phys_footprint` (Activity Monitor's Memory);
resident set on Linux — see [`crate::ProcessMemory`].

status.description:
How the night closed (136 D7): `None` = the model journaled it;
`budget` = the turn ended on the budget guard; `incomplete` = the turn
ended (error, timeout, early stop) before the journal.

